SQL> --4] WRITE A QUERY TO DISPLAY DEPARTMENT NUMBER OF EMPLOYEE WORKING ONLY IF THERE ARE 2 EMPLOYEE WORKING IN EACH DEPARTMENT AS MANAGER ?
SQL> 
SQL> SELECT COUNT(*) , DEPTNO
  2  FROM EMP
  3  WHERE JOB ='MANAGER'
  4  GROUP BY DEPTNO
  5  HAVING COUNT(*) =2;

no rows selected

