SQL> --10] WRITE A QUERY TO DISPLAYMINIMUM AND MAXIMUM SALARY OF EACH JOB IF MIN SAL IS MORE THAN 1000 AND MAX SAL IS LESS THAN 3000 ?
SQL> 
SQL> 
SQL> SELECT MIN(SAL), MAX(SAL), JOB
  2  FROM EMP
  3  GROUP BY JOB
  4  HAVING MIN(SAL)>1000 AND MAX(SAL) <3000;

  MIN(SAL)   MAX(SAL) JOB                                                       
---------- ---------- ---------                                                 
      1250       1600 SALESMAN                                                  
      2450       2975 MANAGER                                                   

SQL> 
